  "brief": {
    "zh": "第 1 天属于旧账。其后的所有区域都要复查 22 至 28°C 的独立读数。提交清洗底稿和有效窗口，最后只交编号、温度两列，温度较高的先处理，同温取较小编号在前。",
    "en": "Day 1 belongs to the old ledger. For all later days, recheck distinct readings from 22 through 28°C across all areas. Deliver the cleaned evidence and time window, then just the IDs and temperatures, hottest first with lower IDs first on ties."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "时间窗口、去重与双边查询",
    "en": "Time window, deduplication and bounded queries"
  },
